    "content": "Roulette is one of the most iconic and popular games in casinos worldwide, renowned for its blend of simplicity and excitement. The game involves a spinning wheel with numbered pockets ranging from 0 to 36, with an additional 00 pocket in American roulette. Players place bets on where they believe the ball will land after the wheel is spun. This game is a fascinating study in probability because each spin is an independent event, with the outcome determined purely by chance. The presence of zero and double zero pockets gives the house an edge, which is a crucial aspect of the casino's profitability."
